                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">While we want to make it easier to connect ShapeDiver instances in Grasshopper, it currently involves creating a JSON theme file and storing it in a public online location.

The example for this tutorial is stored here:

https://shapediverdownloads.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/BETA-InstancesTutorial1-Theme.json</item>
                  </items>
