                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">To use the theme file, just use the "g" query parameter in your App's url and set it to the location of the theme file.

For example, if the App's URL is
https://www.shapediver.com/app/builder/v1/main/latest/?slug=MY_APP

then just add the theme file as follows:

https://www.shapediver.com/app/builder/v1/main/latest/?slug=MY_APP&amp;g=THEME_FILE_URL

In our example:

https://www.shapediver.com/app/builder/v1/main/latest/?slug=beta-instancestutorial1-controller&amp;g=https://shapediverdownloads.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/BETA-InstancesTutorial1-Theme.json
</item>
